{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "爱理", "steam": "愛理"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "愛理"}, "voice": {"chs": "ar1498", "steam": "ar1498", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「是吗……所以瓜生你才对气氛那么敏感呢」", "steam": "「這樣啊……所以瓜生才會莫名對氣氛很敏感啊。」"}, "length": {"chs": 20, "steam": 23}, "similarity": 0.471}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "倒也不是，除了和濑名以外，最近我已经没那么会察言观色了……", "steam": "不過，最近對瀨名以外的人都不怎麼在意了……"}, "length": {"chs": 29, "steam": 21}, "similarity": 0.326}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_14.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "但是，我还是想着只要回应她一个人就可以了。\\n原来坠入爱河的男人会变成这样，真是有些滑稽。", "steam": "即使如此，只有對她還是會想回答她的任何提問，有了喜歡的女孩後，男生變得真是滑稽呢。"}, "length": {"chs": 45, "steam": 41}, "similarity": 0.333}
